    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>15级 杂兵 控制</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 精界 野兽（植物）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +14</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 29，''强韧'' 27，''反射'' 30，''意志'' 23</span><span>''侦查'' +14</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6，掘穴 6</span><span>''感官'' 震动感知 20</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">包围</div>\n<div class=description>所有邻接该埋伏蔓藤幼体的敌人对定身和受缚的豁免受到-2 减值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}蔓藤攀附✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：触及 2，+20 vs. 强韧<br>命中：12 点伤害，且目标受缚（豁免终止）。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（埋伏蔓藤）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 18（+11）</span><span>''敏捷'' 25（+14）</span><span>''感知'' 15（+9）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 16（+10）</span><span>''智力'' 2（+3）</span><span>''魅力'' 12（+8）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
